{"parse": {"title": "Rules", "pageid": 434, "revid": 1053, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rules\">Rules</span></h2>\n<p>1. You must abide by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.fandom.com/terms-of-use\">Fandom Terms of Use</a>.\n</p><p>2. No disrepect, toxicity or hate to others, especially staff.\n</p><p>3. No nsfw language, pictures, etc.\n</p><p>4. No Spamming ... this includes creating long posts with spaces, repeatedly post, or copy-paste spam.\n</p><p>5. No advertising.\n</p><p>6. No griefing pages (inserting gibberish or fake stats).\n</p><p><br />\nFailure to abide by these rules will result in a warning or punishment depending on the action and context.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023134847\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:434-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261023134847 and revision id 1053. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>", "images": [], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Rules", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Rules", "byteoffset": 0, "anchor": "Rules", "linkAnchor": "Rules"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Rules</span>"}, "_provenance": {"url": "https://animeadventures.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&oldid=1053&prop